0..67 Comment "//! `relocated` resumes a stack that captured access to a variable."
68..71 Comment "//!"
72..147 Comment "//! The continuation resumes under its own frame. Its frames contain copied"
148..225 Comment "//! windows. The view still reads its cell. The checker reports `ViewEscaped`"
226..256 Comment "//! for the `dangling` source."
257..260 Comment "//!"
261..314 Comment "//! The source imports the host early exit interface."
315..382 Comment "//! The handler resumes the continuation. The source runs to `112`."
383..386 Comment "//!"
387..434 Comment "//! A polled Rust future cannot make this move."
435..467 Comment "//! - see: #1183 — `relocated`"
